@startuml

left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus System" {
    usecase "View room availability" as UC1
    usecase "Book room" as UC2
    usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC3
    usecase "Block room" as UC4
    usecase "Unblock room" as UC5
    usecase "Review room usage" as UC6

    Student --> UC1
    Student --> UC2
    Student --> UC3

    Administrator --> UC4
    Administrator --> UC5
    Administrator --> UC6
}

note right of UC2
R1: Future start, duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.
R2: Active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.
R3: A blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
R4: A successful booking produces a confirmation.
end note

' Assumptions:
' 1. A student can cancel only their own booking.
' 2. Administrators do not book rooms.
' 3. Authentication and registration are out of scope.
' 4. Confirmation is part of the Book room result, not a separate user goal.

@enduml